This file gathers and re-exports the iterated approximable map, the least fixed point, the iterates from the bottom, and the approximable fixed-point operator, together with the zero and successor clauses of iteration, monotonicity of composition and of iteration, commutation of a map with its iterates, one-step and multi-step extension of a chain from the master neighbourhood, membership in the least fixed point, and monotonicity of the least fixed point.
